Package: rust-relations-explorer
Architecture: amd64
Priority: optional
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Build a knowledge graph of a Rust codebase and query code relationships
 rust-relations-explorer explores relationships in Rust codebases: it
 builds a knowledge graph and runs queries such as connected files,
 function usage, cycles, paths, hubs, module centrality and trait
 implementations.
